unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years. In 2025 that pair landed at 59% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 54%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 145% of normal on the middle. Grid 15776 had its driest year in 2007 at 54%.</p>"}
